>I've seen a few people mention this.  Why would you want more than one?
>Aside from keeping one around as a spare, what good is it?  Does it make
>your load any lighter to keep half your stuff in one bag of holding, and
>the other half in another?

I have experimented with multiple BOH's. During one game i managed to
obtain 4 BOH's !, i thought i may as well see what i can do with
them. Well i found out that your carrying capacity is less for 
multiple BOH's, it looks like the BOH itself has a finite weight and
any more than one just adds to your pack weight unnecessarily. Though
until i came to my weight limit i did name each BOH to make accessing
my stuff easier. That is i named them:
"SCROLL POTIONS SPELLBOOKS" 
"TOOLS"
"WANDS"
"HOLDING"
But now i don't bother with multiple BOH's.

